    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>What's Missing?</strong> Is a first-person surreal puzzle game where you'll explore the never-ending loop of <i>(almost)</i> identical rooms. Spot the differences in order to escape this infinite magical loop of rooms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPOT THE DIFFERENCES ON A NEXT LEVEL </h2>Challenge yourself with a fast ray of unique levels that makes you to think <i>&quot;outside the box&quot;</i>, as besides physical objects, other abstract aspects might change as well like gravity, color, time etc. Explore these levels in different area's from a magical panetarium to the floating garden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNCOVER A DARK PAST</h2>Follow Gregory's journey to escape this magical loop. But in order to escape, he must confront his dark past.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/2383a1a0fc74609ee81e88f7e3225a6e.avif?t=1711386058\" /></div> ",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/92d65aca3a3d7a1a473f19aa55de7e07.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>What's Missing?</strong> Is a first-person surreal puzzle game where you'll explore the never-ending loop of <i>(almost)</i> identical rooms. Spot the differences in order to escape this infinite magical loop of rooms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/7415e3da02e089b3ae1d4ec40277e508.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SPOT THE DIFFERENCES ON A NEXT LEVEL </h2>Challenge yourself with a fast ray of unique levels that makes you to think <i>&quot;outside the box&quot;</i>, as besides physical objects, other abstract aspects might change as well like gravity, color, time etc. Explore these levels in different area's from a magical panetarium to the floating garden.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.poster.avif?t=1711386058\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.webm?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/e3e6ad17b70e538c0dd65e248412e293.mp4?t=1711386058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNCOVER A DARK PAST</h2>Follow Gregory's journey to escape this magical loop. But in order to escape, he must confront his dark past.<br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009500/extras/2383a1a0fc74609ee81e88f7e3225a6e.avif?t=1711386058\" /></div> ",
